          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of superdifferential form is the generalization of the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+form"} differential form
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/manifolds"} manifolds
            to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supermanifolds"} supermanifolds
          %h2#Definition Definition
          #DifferentialFormsOnSuperCartesianSpace.num_defn
            %h6#definition_2 Definition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+forms"} differential forms
                on
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Cartesian+space"} super Cartesian space
            %p
              For
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
